# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-Side Vite Environment Variable)
# Never commit .env.local or hardcode your API key in source files.
#
# Quickstart with the free Maps Demo Key (no billing or Cloud project required for prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with your Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it.
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below with your key.
#
# For production, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Required APIs: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Elevation API, Weather API.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
